Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.93,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:10.24,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,Five years ago, he was our top agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:13.88,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,Yeah. Took his eye off the ball in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:18.88,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:23.88,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.29,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,Does it have to be him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:33.09,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,He's the only one our contact will talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:36.88,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.93,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:12.60,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,You came here to forget your life of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:08.60,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.43,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,But the path you must tread
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:20.64,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,to new life will be not be easy, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:29.58,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,Our purpose here is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:33.08,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,To strengthen what is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.53,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Make hard what is soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:55.38,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,This will take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:05.02,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Mind must be master of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:13.52,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,Strong mind can separate the body from its suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:18.80,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,Good concentration, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:23.37,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,Sorry? Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.04,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,You are not young.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:36.21,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,But with age comes wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:04:00.04,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,When mind is master of the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:03.75,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,you will be warrior once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:13.86,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,Master, what is my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:19.76,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,I'm in touch with a higher power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:35.24,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,MI7 wants you on the first flight back to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:45.25,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,Master, am I ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.89,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.62,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Window seat or aisle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.92,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:04:59.92,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.39,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:09.29,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.10,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.00,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.47,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:44.92,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.95,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,One moment, please. Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.36,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,Toshiba British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:55.53,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,For electronic products press one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.96,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,To speak to an agent, press two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.76,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:01.33,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,Certainly, sir. Can I redirect you to our website?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.39,0:06:04.89,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,www.spyingforyou.gov.uk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.56,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,Toshiba British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.57,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.63,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.21,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,Pegasus is expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.04,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,Look into the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:21.98,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,Don't smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.98,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.23,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,Pamela Thornton, Head of MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.16,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:33.83,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.73,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,You've been away for some time, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.01,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,But you haven't been forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.61,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:49.07,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,People here often talk about your adventures in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:55.69,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,Well, MI7 has come a long way since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.23,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,The guns, the fast cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.95,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,and the chauvinism are all on their way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:05.12,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,Frankly, I didn't want to see you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:08.20,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,You are everything I came into this service to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.37,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,But my hands are tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.76,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,And there are times when
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.20,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,one has to go against one's better judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.11,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,We have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.87,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:28.31,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,There's a good puss. There's a good puss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:34.12,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,There's a good pussy. Who's a good pussy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.56,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,- I'm impressed. - Who's a good pussy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:39.13,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,Philby never lets strangers pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.06,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,I'm very much at one with the animal kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:44.33,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,There's a good puss. I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:47.14,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Who's lovely? Who's lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:49.90,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.48,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,We're all lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:03.08,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,Kate Sumner, our behavioural psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:04.75,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,I've heard a great deal about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.69,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,Glowing reports, I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.99,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ms. Sumner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:13.26,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,what exactly does a behavioral psychologist do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:17.70,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,Monitor observable behavior for signs of internal psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.61,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,We read people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.68,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,Well, we must get together sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:26.10,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,I think you'll find me a real page-turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:43.39,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,So, Pegasus, this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:47.19,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,Ex-CIA agent Titus Fisher
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.63,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,has contacted us from Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.96,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,He has intelligence of a plot to assassinate the Chinese Premier
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:54.06,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,at the Anglo-Chinese talks next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:57.63,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,We need you to go and find out what he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:00.81,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, Pegasus, count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.81,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,Agent One will meet you downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:12.42,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,So, I just scaled the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.56,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,blew the whole place to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:15.94,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,An hour later I'm sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.15,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,in the bar with a White Russian in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:21.40,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,Who was very lovely, too, I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.59,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.27,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,Hello, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:31.03,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Simon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.71,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,you look wonderful. But, then, you always did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.10,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,Welcome back. How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:36.84,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:40.41,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,Five years, three months and six days, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.01,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,Of course, Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:48.19,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,That was a balls-up with a cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:51.05,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get you sorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.03,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Welcome to the toy cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:06.54,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,I won't leave you my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:07.74,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,You know Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.71,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,Patch Quartermain, the man himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.81,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,English.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:13.04,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,Please, don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.48,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,No chance of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:20.08,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,Lost them testing the B-6 exploding brogues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.72,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:24.59,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,Have to be this one, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.59,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,Lost this to the D-10 doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:32.40,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,Ah. Well, it's great to see what's left of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:36.84,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,This is rather good fun, actually. Top speed of 60 mph,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:40.11,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,and I've managed to add the odd thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.75,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,This way. I haven't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:47.92,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:51.46,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,Would you stop meddling, English?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:52.99,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.76,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,Ah, the Rolls-Royce Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:59.19,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,Truly the Rolls-Royce of automobiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:01.50,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,Armour plating, all the bells and whistles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.86,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,Say "Bonnet."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:05.63,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,- Bonnet. - Command accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:09.30,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,Voice activation recognises only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.30,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,Rolls has fitted one of their experimental engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:16.61,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,The nine-litre V16. Goes like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:19.38,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,Only quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.72,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:22.98,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,Keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.62,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,Here's what you'll be taking to Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:28.79,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,- Ah, yes. - A satellite receiver,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.13,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,tracking device, Semtex chewing gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.32,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,Now, what did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.97,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,That's the new P-two digital dart gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:43.55,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Gentlemen. May I remind you all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:47.24,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,that MI7's current weapon of choice is dialogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:50.65,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,We do love it when you get strict, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:56.65,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,English, you go to Hong Kong tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.81,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,Fisher will contact you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.48,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,To ensure protocol is observed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:06.02,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,I'm sending someone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:07.19,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,Agent Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.53,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,It will be an honour, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:16.67,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,Well, it'll be good to have somebody to carry the bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:21.44,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,You made a laughing stock out of this service once, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.35,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,Not on my watch. Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:26.21,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,Crystal clear, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.39,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,Just like old times, eh, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.93,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,I'm off to Switzerland. Let's catch up when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.13,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,There's nothing I'd like more, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:47.37,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen the voice-changing travel lozenges?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.55,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.95,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.35,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.65,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:18.65,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.27,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,Come on, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.78,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,I'm not 21 till September, sir. I'm not really allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.78,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,Tucker, you're an agent working for Her Majesty's Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.62,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,Just act the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:52.10,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,Ten thousand dollars' worth, please, my lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.27,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:58.34,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,And a receipt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.32,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,Be alert for contact, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:11.22,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,We're looking for a Chinese man in spectacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.16,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,Would you like another drink, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:18.46,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,Sir, the Chinese man in spectacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.46,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,- One more beer. - No more bets, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:26.29,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,Contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.97,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:57.93,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,Your grandmother is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:59.16,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:03.54,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,Your grandmother is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:06.67,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,Well, she's dead. That's how sick she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.79,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,Is he dead, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.86,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.86,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.38,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,- Hi, Mum. - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.25,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. Nothing's the matter, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:56.55,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,I felt a bit funny last night, but I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.60,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,So, what have you got for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:06.78,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,The people behind the plot to kill Xiang Ping, the Chinese Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.07,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,A group called Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.40,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,Never heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:13.07,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,Paid assassins. The best there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.28,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,Come on, Fisher, I need names, I need evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.69,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,Vortex has a secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.53,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,This is one of three keys that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.67,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,when used together, gain access to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.79,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,Without this, Vortex is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:41.30,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,How did you get hold of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.77,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.17,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:48.38,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,Vortex is three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:54.79,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,Come off it, Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:57.92,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,You, a hired assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.86,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,You couldn't hit a barn door with a banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.22,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,And as for Vortex,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:07.06,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,clearly you got the name off a box of washing powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.36,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,Vortex was in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:12.70,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.36,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,Yeah? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:19.17,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,Mum? Mum, Mum, I gotta go. Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.71,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,We were all there that day, Johnny-boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.54,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,- Excuse me. Sir! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.68,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,Sir, there's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:30.42,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,Quick, come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.66,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,Madam, let me help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:47.60,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,Here. Yes, I think you should vacate the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.68,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,There are some very dangerous people about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.07,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.38,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,Get after her, Tucker, get after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:13.12,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.64,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,Sir! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:29.41,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,Over here, Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.78,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,I lost her, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:33.11,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:40.42,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,This way, sir! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:44.46,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,You get down to the street. I'll take the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:25.67,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,You are not young. But with age comes wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:49.25,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,Hand it over, chimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:18.25,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.51,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,Come on, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.28,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.76,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,I am commandeering this vessel in the name of Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.95,0:22:01.48,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,Right-O, Wing Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:03.69,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.48,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,Now, what's your poison? Can I get you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:28.98,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,We've got vodka, rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:34.38,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,Your safety is our priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.12,0:22:38.86,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,But you can help us by familiarizing yourself with this leaflet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.74,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Creme de menthe, a smidgen of port,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:45.80,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,and that's about it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:50.84,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,I'm Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.73,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,Hello, Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:23:00.65,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,Just a tad to your left, Shirley. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:00.25,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:45.23,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,I say, Wing Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:46.23,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.23,0:23:49.83,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:27.97,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,- Well played, sir! Well played! - Just like a gladiator!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:56.02,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,Come on. Put 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:24.96,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,Well played, sir! Well played!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.17,0:25:46.71,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,More champagne, my lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:48.08,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,Certainly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.18,0:25:50.42,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,Tucker are you sure you don't want a Shandy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:53.82,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,I have got to finish this mission report, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:56.52,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,And Pegasus wants to see us as soon as we touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.05,0:25:59.43,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,The mission report?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.65,0:26:01.86,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Tucker. Live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:05.67,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,You should learn to savour success.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.73,0:26:07.50,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,Work hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:11.50,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,play hard. Isn't that right...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.73,0:26:13.84,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,Barbara?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.05,0:26:33.59,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,Vortex is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:36.03,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,But better still,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:36.62,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,for years
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:39.80,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,I believed what happened in Mozambique was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:44.73,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,Now I realise it was only partly my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.37,0:26:47.87,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,What did happen in Mozambique?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.08,0:27:01.72,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. We're coming in to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:03.89,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,Can I stow that overhead for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.16,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:10.93,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,Sir, I don't think he's a "Susan."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:14.33,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,But then you're not a linguist, are you, Tucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.43,0:27:18.64,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,It's not "Susan," its "Shoooshan."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:21.09,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,From the Xinzhou region,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.09,0:27:23.18,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,unless I'm very much mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.07,0:27:25.78,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shoooshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:43.13,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,Foreign Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:46.36,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,I hope you've got something for us, English.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.46,0:27:48.60,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,The Prime Minister is extremely concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.80,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,He has every reason to be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.13,0:27:54.20,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,There is a plot to kill the Chinese Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:58.81,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,Masterminded by a group of ruthless assassins called Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.81,0:28:00.94,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,Good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.01,0:28:04.01,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,The danger, however, has been averted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.98,0:28:08.36,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,Now that we have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:15.49,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,English?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.49,0:28:16.69,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,Now, I know what you're going to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:20.30,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,it's a pretty small object.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:25.90,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,Well, it's often the little things that pack the biggest punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:29.67,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,- After all, David killed Goliath with a pebble. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:32.60,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,The mighty Vortex has been slain by
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:35.85,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,my possession of this small key.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.37,0:29:02.61,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,Shoooshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.87,0:29:05.87,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:12.25,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,We got it, but Fisher talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:18.09,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,Understood. We'll deal with English.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:24.43,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,You've got some more cleaning to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:28.87,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,Mummy, Mummy! Mr. Rhubarb's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:31.54,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,Izzie, darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:33.94,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,why don't you show him into the conservatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.21,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,I'll be with you in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:37.81,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Okay. Come on, come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:39.82,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,- Shall we? - Hurry up, Mr. Rhubarb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:44.45,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,Perhaps when you've found your key, you'll give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.54,0:29:46.58,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, Foreign Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:48.55,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,I had hoped to have more for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.96,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:25.93,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,Pegasus! I've got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.62,0:30:27.69,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,Come on, you witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.79,0:30:28.82,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,English?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.92,0:30:32.46,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,She was in Hong Kong! She's the killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.59,0:30:34.09,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,She's my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:37.84,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,Couldn't she be both?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:44.81,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,Mummy, Mummy, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.77,0:30:47.81,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,Let me get you a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:53.45,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,- You'll be fine, Mummy. - Who was that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:58.33,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think a cup of tea, that's what's required.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.62,0:31:06.73,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,Pegasus, I am truly, truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:09.67,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,Don't apologise to me. Apologise to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.38,0:31:26.98,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,I cannot apologise enough, Mrs. Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:31.66,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,It was a simple case of mistaken identity, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:33.83,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,Now, I completely understand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.89,0:31:35.83,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,how upset you are, but I was hoping perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:42.90,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:47.61,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,Tucker! That's her! It's the killer from Hong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:50.44,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,- No, it's not her, sir. - It is! This time it's really her!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:53.52,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,- It's not her, sir! - Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.01,0:32:02.36,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:04.19,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.25,0:32:07.36,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,You murderous crone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:12.03,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,Granny! What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.76,0:32:14.07,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,Take that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.86,0:32:17.71,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:21.24,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,English!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:24.72,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,I've got her this time, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:29.08,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,This is the witch who works for Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:31.59,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,Want any more you old hag?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:33.45,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,- English! - Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:46.66,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,You humiliate me in front of the Foreign Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:48.42,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,you lose our only lead on Vortex,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.23,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,and then you try and kill my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.30,0:32:52.57,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,Twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.57,0:32:55.46,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,Pegasus, we have another lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:57.11,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,Vortex was in Mozambique!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.24,0:33:00.45,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,They were responsible for the death of President Chambal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.57,0:33:04.58,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,No! You were responsible for the death of President Chambal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:19.29,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly gave Mr.Rhubarb a run for his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:25.77,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,Still, at least we know Vortex was in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.43,0:33:28.71,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,When you told Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:32.01,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,you displayed all four indicators of someone telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.80,0:33:40.92,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.30,0:33:43.62,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:41.99,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,This is a facial action coding system.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.62,0:33:46.15,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,Its high-speed cameras record microexpressions
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.29,0:33:47.82,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,invisible to the naked eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:50.16,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,It detects what we call emotional leakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.29,0:33:54.17,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,Ms.Sumner, I'm a trained agent. I don't "Leak."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:57.30,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,I want to take you back to Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.67,0:34:00.41,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,Is that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:03.98,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.74,0:34:07.91,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,I want to take you back to Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.74,0:34:12.38,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:14.65,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,Could we call that leakage?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.98,0:34:16.25,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,Now, play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.25,0:34:19.33,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,I'm taking a risk being here after hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:21.89,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,If Vortex was in Mozambique,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:23.20,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,perhaps you saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:26.20,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you back there using hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.33,0:34:27.40,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.40,0:34:30.10,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,Spare me the new age mumbo jumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.10,0:34:33.00,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,Mr.English, please. I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:34.50,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,I'm not going to just snap my fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:38.35,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,and make you say the first thing that comes into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.44,0:34:39.94,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,Plump pillows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.04,0:34:41.71,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:45.58,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,Brilliant mind. Beautiful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:47.02,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:50.69,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,And completely out of my league.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.52,0:34:59.90,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,I'd like to take you back to Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.86,0:35:08.01,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,Tell me what's happening, Johnny. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.80,0:35:11.65,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,President Chambal's inauguration day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.31,0:35:15.05,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,Yes, you're head of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.71,0:35:19.75,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,Everything's going perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:22.05,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,Today we climb the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.22,0:35:23.99,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,Agent English.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:29.89,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,The people have spoken, and the message is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.26,0:35:33.40,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,A future of peace and prosperity!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.49,0:35:36.67,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,The backup electrical supply has been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.90,0:35:41.94,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,No, it hasn't. It's been turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.90,0:35:45.94,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Do you know how to turn it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.77,0:35:49.91,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,I should be getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:54.25,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,Well, operations like this are always difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.25,0:35:56.82,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,But it's very satisfying when you get a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:59.33,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,The President couldn't be in safer hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:01.96,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,The future belongs to Mozambique!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:04.09,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.94,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,The fireworks have begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.93,0:36:11.14,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,The sound of freedom and celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:20.87,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,Easy, Johnny. Easy. Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:23.65,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Before the Jacuzzi, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:30.78,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:33.16,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.99,0:36:37.30,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,On the terrace with two others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.39,0:36:41.46,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,Yes. All three members of Vortex were there that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.56,0:36:44.91,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,Who can you see? Who can you see, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:50.68,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,Artem Karlenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.97,0:36:56.48,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Artem Karlenko, double agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.58,0:36:59.32,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,Recruited by MI7 in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:01.98,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,Retired after his penchant for killing people
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.98,0:37:02.65,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,threatened his cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.58,0:37:05.65,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,Five years ago, he turned up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:08.32,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,as Sergei Pudovkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.42,0:37:10.20,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,Rich, very rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:12.49,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,A member of the exclusive Oakwood Golf Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.49,0:37:13.87,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,which is where you'll be meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.99,0:37:16.75,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,He's in a match play competition, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.75,0:37:18.97,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,I'm making you his opponent for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.24,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:25.01,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,Done it, sir. You're booked in as Mr.Peter Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.61,0:37:29.09,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.24,0:37:32.61,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,If Karlenko is Vortex,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.61,0:37:35.38,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,I want you to bring him in. Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.47,0:38:02.48,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,Mr.Pussykin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.88,0:38:06.62,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,Pudovkin. And you must be Mr. ...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:12.39,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:15.22,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,Beautiful car, Mr.Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:17.13,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,Ah, the Royce.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:18.29,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,Ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.06,0:38:20.23,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.89,0:38:22.40,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.06,0:38:24.23,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:25.74,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,Command accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:30.48,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,So, what line of business are you in, Mr.Adams?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.57,0:38:31.74,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Pudovkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:35.31,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,Sorry. Yes, I'm Mr Adams, and you're Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.41,0:38:37.91,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,Whoever you said you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.01,0:38:39.92,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,- Well... - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.75,0:38:45.92,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,Sorry, I thought I had forgotten something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.35,0:39:13.79,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,Glove, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:17.12,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,I may not know much about golf, Tucker,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.18,0:39:19.72,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,but I know how to hold the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.21,0:39:47.66,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,Shot, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.93,0:40:05.40,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,So, what line of business are you in, Mr.Puddykin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.50,0:40:08.57,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,I made my money in the removals business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:14.21,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,A friend of mine had shares in a removals business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:15.64,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,Titus Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.64,0:40:17.95,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,You haven't come across him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:22.12,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,I warn you, Mr.Adams, not to stray into the rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.62,0:40:25.03,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,You get in there, you might never come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:27.19,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,I'll bear that in mind, Mr.Puddykin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.29,0:40:30.10,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,Pudovkin. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.94,0:40:45.21,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.07,0:40:48.71,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,As was my friend Fisher, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.65,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,in the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:55.82,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,by his cleaner, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.89,0:41:05.10,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,But they didn't take much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.76,0:41:06.83,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,Just a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.77,0:41:16.47,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,Break, left to right, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.57,0:41:17.78,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.23,0:41:19.13,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.26,0:41:42.76,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,In the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:48.18,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.17,0:41:52.62,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,- Oh, my god. - He can't die. He mustn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:54.71,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,Let's get him out of here. Come on! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:42:00.32,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,He's not looking good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.31,0:42:04.89,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,We're getting you to a doctor. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:08.36,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,You do know how to fly this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.45,0:42:10.70,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,- It was part of basic training. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.79,0:42:12.63,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,It's just like riding a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.87,0:42:21.47,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,Yes. It's all coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:47.26,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,This is helicopter Golf Hotel Zulu Zulu Tango.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.36,0:42:48.83,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,We have a casualty on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.83,0:42:50.77,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,Request guidance to nearest hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.86,0:42:52.17,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,Where's your exact location?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:53.61,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,Our location? Location?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.23,0:42:56.58,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,She shot out the navigation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.05,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.58,0:43:11.43,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,- Runstock. - Our location is Runstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:12.62,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,What is your altitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.72,0:43:14.60,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,What's our altitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.42,0:43:18.46,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,About 18 inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.09,0:43:21.57,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.30,0:43:26.24,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'll just move.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.23,0:43:29.87,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,What now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.94,0:43:33.54,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,We'll have to stick to the road. Let's follow the 1328.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.61,0:43:35.14,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,There's bound to be a hospital in Dingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.24,0:43:37.28,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:44.05,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,Look after him, Tucker. Look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:52.18,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,I think we're losing him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.18,0:43:53.73,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,We can't lose him, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.79,0:43:57.43,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,He's our only lead. Try something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.07,0:44:06.57,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,Don't give up on us, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.64,0:44:12.65,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,Lord knows we've come this far
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.58,0:44:23.83,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,We are the angel and the dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.36,0:44:30.17,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,Don't give up on us, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.76,0:44:34.27,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,We could still come through
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.15,0:44:53.19,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,Look, sir! Follow that ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.29,0:44:54.79,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.40,0:45:07.17,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,Sir. Sir, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.74,0:45:13.18,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,Karlenko. Karlenko!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.38,0:45:22.09,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,The second key.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.65,0:45:29.42,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,Vortex is KGB...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.42,0:45:35.23,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,- Yes. - CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:37.57,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,Yes? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:46.55,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.18,0:45:57.13,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. A vole in MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.75,0:46:01.56,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,A mole, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.52,0:46:03.86,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.29,0:46:06.46,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,There's a mole in MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:09.70,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,There's a mole and a vole?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.30,0:46:13.74,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,No, sir. There's a mole, not a vole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.47,0:46:16.91,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,Well, I disagree. There's certainly a vole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:18.74,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,I mean, we know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.80,0:46:22.41,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,But what you're saying is there might be a mole as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.24,0:46:25.45,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.91,0:46:30.62,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,There's a meeting at MI7 with the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.81,0:46:36.22,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.22,0:46:40.00,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,And here again, eyes down and to the left, indicating dissent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:42.43,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,With Xiang Ping, it's all about the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.43,0:46:43.30,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ms.Sumner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:46.14,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,If the talks go ahead, I'd like you with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.73,0:46:48.41,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,Yes, Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:51.34,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,Good evening, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.44,0:46:52.85,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,- Mr.English. - Ms.Sumner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.61,0:46:56.81,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.14,0:46:59.47,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,So when is the Prime Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.47,0:47:02.46,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,going to grace us with his presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.82,0:47:04.59,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,I'm the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.68,0:47:06.63,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.30,0:47:19.54,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,All right. So we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.17,0:47:26.12,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,These talks with China are of paramount importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.17,0:47:27.52,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,Rogue states in Southeast Asia
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.61,0:47:29.88,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,have begun secretly to develop nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.98,0:47:32.85,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,It is vital that we get China onside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.95,0:47:35.79,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,Traditionally, China has been impervious to our concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.85,0:47:38.12,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,but I believe Xiang Ping, given the opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.18,0:47:41.83,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,can and will help defuse this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.95,0:47:44.37,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,Well, with his pro-West stance,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:46.23,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,it certainly offers an opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.33,0:47:50.06,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,but the talks can't go ahead unless we can guarantee his safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:52.50,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,I believe, with the correct security, that we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.50,0:47:55.57,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,If Vortex is operational, it's just too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.67,0:47:58.55,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,I'm inclined to agree, Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:02.18,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,There is a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.21,0:48:06.52,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,The Swiss are willing to lend us Le Bastion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.52,0:48:09.22,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,That's their government fortress in the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.22,0:48:13.72,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,It's a stunning example of architectural engineering at altitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.82,0:48:16.66,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,and completely impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:20.19,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,I mean, that should solve all our security issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.99,0:48:22.84,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,Then the talks go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:25.00,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,Pamela, I hope you've brushed up on your Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.20,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,I'd like you in the room with me, and
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.20,0:48:28.77,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,your best man on security.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.87,0:48:30.71,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,Yes, Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.67,0:48:35.02,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,Where are we on Vortex?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.18,0:48:37.25,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,English?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.88,0:48:39.64,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,Vortex is three men.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.64,0:48:42.88,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,Fisher was one, Karlenko was another.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.02,0:48:46.90,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,Karlenko was killed today on the orders of the third.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.09,0:48:49.57,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Any leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.69,0:48:51.86,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,Yes, but I need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.92,0:48:53.77,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,We do not have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.86,0:48:58.04,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,We need to know the identity of the third person in Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.24,0:49:05.04,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,Give me 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:18.13,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,Another bottle of Romainee-Conti?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.05,0:49:20.96,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,Of course. And would you like to choose dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.05,0:49:23.09,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,Yes. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.92,0:49:27.10,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,And bring two spoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.90,0:49:33.64,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,- Cheers. - Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.90,0:49:41.25,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,So, come on, Johnny, what was it you wanted to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.78,0:49:50.16,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,Simon, do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.80,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,Some sort of key?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.92,0:49:58.59,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,Karlenko and Fisher both had one,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:50:01.43,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,and they were both killed for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.33,0:50:06.71,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,Well, I'll give it to the boys at the lab and see...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.80,0:50:13.15,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,Karlenko told me that the third man in Vortex is in MI7.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.68,0:50:23.32,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,And you believed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.98,0:50:30.49,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,Simon, I have to ask you a question, face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.79,0:50:37.14,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who it might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.83,0:50:43.30,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,Johnny, I thought you were about to accuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:44.81,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,No! I mean, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:48.81,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,- What? - Simon Ambrose, the evil mastermind!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.87,0:50:50.82,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,- Don't. Stop it. - The traitor in our midst!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.88,0:50:52.32,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,You! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.01,0:50:55.69,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,Simon, you are so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.08,0:50:58.49,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,Hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.82,0:51:01.02,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:04.59,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.59,0:51:07.20,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,Would you excuse me for one moment, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.17,0:51:23.24,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,- Sir. - Tucker, can't this wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.34,0:51:25.05,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,Sir, it's Ambrose.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.68,0:51:27.42,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it's Ambrose. I'm having dinner with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.51,0:51:30.19,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,No, he's the third man in Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.88,0:51:33.86,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,Simon Ambrose?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:37.56,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,He went to Eton.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.69,0:51:40.97,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.06,0:51:42.20,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.30,0:51:46.37,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,- What are you... - Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.47,0:51:48.57,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,- All right, all right. - Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.70,0:51:50.37,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:54.74,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,- You said you never knew Karlenko. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.87,0:51:57.41,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,Then how do you explain these?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.04,0:52:00.25,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,I hacked into Karlenko's computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.25,0:52:02.05,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,You and him in Mozambique?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.18,0:52:33.09,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,Sometimes I have trouble myself, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.76,0:52:53.61,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,You're Vortex! You're the third man in Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.70,0:52:54.87,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,Tucker, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.14,0:52:58.05,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll be with you in just a tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.37,0:53:00.11,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,It's true, I was in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.04,0:53:02.31,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.78,0:53:06.12,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,I was there because of Patch Quartermain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.18,0:53:10.02,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,Patch? Sorry, I'll just be one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:12.99,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,He's the man you're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.49,0:53:15.62,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,- You're bluffing! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.62,0:53:19.12,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,I work for a secret organisation inside MI7
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.12,0:53:21.83,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,set up specifically to bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.70,0:53:24.68,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,A secret Secret Service?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.80,0:53:27.18,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,Yeah? What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:29.80,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:31.34,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.64,0:53:32.98,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,Armitage.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.21,0:53:36.81,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,A secret secret secret service called Armitage?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.21,0:53:39.52,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,We answer only to the PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.85,0:53:44.16,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,It's extraordinary, Simon...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.68,0:53:46.03,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.15,0:53:49.36,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,...That you'd think for one moment
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.49,0:53:54.56,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,that I would fall for such a steaming pile of old baloney.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:56.10,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,Well done, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.10,0:53:57.90,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,You're not Spy of the Month for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.00,0:54:01.21,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,- Thank you, sir. - Here, let me take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.33,0:54:02.54,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,Now go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.67,0:54:06.62,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,- What? - You're the one talking baloney.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.71,0:54:09.52,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,You're in way over your head, boy. Now run along.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.58,0:54:13.05,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,No! I won't go, sir. He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.18,0:54:16.46,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,You've let me down, you've let the Service down,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.55,0:54:18.62,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,and, frankly, I think you've let yourself down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.72,0:54:21.39,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,- But I... - Now get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.26,0:54:29.93,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,Patch Quartermain, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.93,0:54:31.40,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,Blowing his own legs off?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.53,0:54:34.53,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call deep cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.60,0:54:36.44,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,And to think how much I admired him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.54,0:54:37.61,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,He hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.57,0:54:40.88,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,- Really? - He always has.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.94,0:54:44.25,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,He thinks you're a moron with no place in MI7,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.38,0:54:47.56,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,a jumped-up grammar school nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.56,0:54:50.78,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,That's why he tried to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.95,0:54:54.83,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,Now, Johnny, just because he ruined your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.92,0:54:55.95,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,that's no reason for you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.96,0:54:57.76,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,to go rogue and take him down on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.43,0:55:04.07,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,God forbid I should put a crazy idea like that in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:08.07,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,Good night, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.13,0:55:10.25,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,Johnny,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.25,0:55:13.61,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,that key you showed me. We might need it to bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.58,0:55:21.99,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - You're welcome, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.62,0:55:24.99,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,Silly tit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.92,0:55:31.13,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.76,0:55:35.76,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,- Arrange a meeting with our client - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.62,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.81,0:55:53.62,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,We have the third man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.32,0:55:58.30,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,It's Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.13,0:56:10.63,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,Hello, Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.30,0:56:13.37,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,Looking for forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.63,0:56:20.48,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,It's all over for you now, English. It's the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.97,0:56:23.58,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,Yes, you'd like that, wouldn't you, Patch?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.68,0:56:27.99,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,After all, I'm just a jumped-up grammar school nobody, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.51,0:56:30.02,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.32,0:56:36.70,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,I know that you are the third man in Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.33,0:56:43.03,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,No, Johnny. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.23,0:56:45.67,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,No, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.73,0:56:47.51,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,No. You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.33,0:56:51.51,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,Standby, all agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.57,0:56:53.85,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,And it all ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.88,0:57:00.05,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.39,0:57:44.73,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.30,0:57:52.20,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.80,0:57:57.94,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.91,0:58:01.59,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.17,0:58:03.52,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.58,0:58:06.11,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,Don't lose him. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.28,0:58:07.42,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.29,0:58:24.33,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,Heading west into Vine Street. Mobilise all vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.85,0:58:37.02,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.47,0:59:02.47,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.54,0:59:13.39,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,You've lost him! I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.36,0:59:29.84,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,Oi! Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.57,1:00:09.77,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.90,1:00:28.33,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.90,1:00:43.07,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,Agent English, pull over! Pullover!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.00,1:00:48.92,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.45,1:01:09.71,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.16,1:01:11.27,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.30,1:01:16.47,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,Get after him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.79,1:01:36.85,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,Kate, Kate,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.85,1:01:38.96,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,I'm not Vortex. I've been framed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.03,1:01:42.37,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,You must believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.22,1:02:10.53,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,How will it be done?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.59,1:02:16.88,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,Same as in Mozambique.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.88,1:02:18.60,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,One person, apparently working alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.07,1:02:21.41,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,Who have you chosen?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.07,1:02:23.67,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,Leave that with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.57,1:02:28.68,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,My account in Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.68,1:02:31.58,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,500 million US dollars, as agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:48.60,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,You've been out for hours
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.04,1:03:03.71,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,Well, you're lucky it was just a flesh wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.78,1:03:06.15,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,Now, look, I'm going to Switzerland tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.16,1:03:08.16,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,but you can stay here while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.05,1:03:11.61,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,I've been going through the
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.61,1:03:14.33,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,news footage from the night Chambal was killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:17.32,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,And there's something not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.42,1:03:19.60,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,Seconds after President Chambal was shot,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.66,1:03:22.00,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,the assassin collapses and dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.09,1:03:25.34,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,And the autopsy says heart failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.43,1:03:30.47,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,But, if you go through the classified CCTV footage...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:35.41,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.94,1:03:37.58,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.61,1:03:40.68,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.35,1:03:44.36,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Fifteen minutes before the assassination, look,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.36,1:03:46.99,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,he's manic.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.09,1:03:49.76,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,He's completely lost control of his body
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:52.83,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,And then, suddenly, catatonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.33,1:03:56.97,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,Here, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.30,1:03:59.50,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.93,1:04:02.14,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,Someone was talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.94,1:04:09.78,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,I don't think he had any idea what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.84,1:04:12.34,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,I think Vortex's secret weapon...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.11,1:04:16.35,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,Is a mind control drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.45,1:04:18.83,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,And only one fits the symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.22,1:04:24.46,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,Timox... Timoxylin Bubby...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.52,1:04:26.40,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,Timoxeline Barbebutenol.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.96,1:04:30.30,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,The CIA ordered its destruction 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.36,1:04:33.81,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,And the agent in charge of its disposal...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:36.57,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,Titus Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.84,1:04:42.98,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:45.82,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,I'd love a take-away.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.15,1:04:48.85,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:52.83,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,Flying low.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:05.54,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,So, Johnny, what are you going to do about Vortex?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.03,1:05:11.71,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,I don't know. If only Simon was here. He'd know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.77,1:05:14.25,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,Why do you think he's better than you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.87,1:05:16.88,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,Well, the man's a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.18,1:05:19.18,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,Well, I prefer mortals.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.11,1:05:24.79,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,Pure, complicated, maddening mortals.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.68,1:05:29.29,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,I've come to realise that what's really exciting to me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.39,1:05:32.75,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,is great loyalty, determination,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.75,1:05:34.43,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,and courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.93,1:05:39.10,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,You have always fascinated me, clinically.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.23,1:05:42.94,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,But now you...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.74,1:05:49.58,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,Ms Sumner, your pupils are dilating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.97,1:05:51.78,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,Are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.28,1:05:55.78,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,Your cheeks are colouring.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.15,1:05:58.42,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,Eye contact deepening.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.78,1:06:00.66,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,Heart-rate rising.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.95,1:06:08.93,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,Ms Sumner, I believe we're emotionally leaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.66,1:06:15.51,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,- The bedroom, quickly. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.17,1:06:17.41,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.44,1:06:27.42,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.48,1:06:29.82,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,- Oh, Simon. - Hi, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.42,1:06:32.95,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,You ready? I'll drive you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.02,1:06:35.66,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,How nice. I'll just get my bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.63,1:06:41.97,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,You alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.09,1:06:43.83,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,No. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.93,1:06:45.10,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,Been working?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.16,1:06:48.94,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,Been brushing up on the Chinese PM. You?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.00,1:06:50.84,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,We're trying to track clown Johnny English
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.54,1:06:58.99,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,There's some questions we want to ask him, about Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.04,1:07:00.68,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you've seen him, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.78,1:07:01.85,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.96,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,Not hiding him away?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:08.96,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,Not my type. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.36,1:07:53.40,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,Ambrose.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.13,1:09:29.80,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,There's a Mr Adams to see you, Colin.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.43,1:09:34.17,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,- Hello, Tucker. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.27,1:09:37.18,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,Every agent in the country is after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.27,1:09:38.68,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,We were right about Ambrose
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:40.71,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,What do you mean "we"?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.81,1:09:42.11,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,And if we can act fast, we can still...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.17,1:09:44.45,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,You wouldn't listen, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.51,1:09:47.39,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,You think you know it all. Well' you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.48,1:09:50.29,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,Being an agent means everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:52.62,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,And, thanks to you, I'm suspended!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.99,1:09:56.02,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,Would you boys like some orange squash?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.12,1:09:58.00,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,- No, thank you. - Bye, thanks, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.12,1:10:03.61,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,Tucker, Ambrose is in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.61,1:10:05.47,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,We are in duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.53,1:10:09.67,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,I am here because my country needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.70,1:10:14.98,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,And because it needs you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.23,1:10:36.93,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,- Royce. - Ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.60,1:10:39.07,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.50,1:10:46.11,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,Obstruction detected.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.19,1:11:09.60,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,Set the sat nav for Switzerland Let's kick some bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.43,1:11:23.58,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.66,1:11:44.90,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,You have arrived at your destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.96,1:11:47.74,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,Good luck, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:11:57.58,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,Le Bastion.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.59,1:12:01.42,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,One way up, one way down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:06.63,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's get the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.59,1:12:15.37,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,Whoa, look. The T-2 ground-to-air missile!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.43,1:12:19.10,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,That's a D-7 bulletproof shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.04,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,Take it from me, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.13,1:12:24.01,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,I was working with these while you were stringing conkers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.13,1:12:55.58,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,The P-8 grapple hook?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.73,1:12:57.97,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.04,1:12:59.74,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,- Estimated height? - Thirty-five feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.84,1:13:01.34,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,All yours, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.41,1:13:03.25,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,Can I just say, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:07.18,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,This is just great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.75,1:13:11.56,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,Well, go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.52,1:13:22.44,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,The D-16 ascender, and up we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.33,1:13:24.86,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's the ascender, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.93,1:13:26.53,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I'd know it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.23,1:13:30.37,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,Agent in distress. Agent in distress.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.68,1:13:43.78,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,Agent in distress. Agent in distress.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.55,1:13:48.26,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,I am over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.35,1:13:50.09,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.19,1:13:52.03,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,I am over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:04.71,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,Activating visual locater.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.77,1:14:08.24,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.17,1:14:13.32,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.25,1:14:16.88,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,Intruders in Sector Four!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.55,1:14:27.16,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,Dear God, let me not die at the hands of the Swiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.59,1:14:31.80,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,Tucker, now listen. I want you to attack me
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.90,1:14:33.50,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,- What? - After a struggle,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.60,1:14:37.41,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,you can "Arrest me". And take me inside as your prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.47,1:14:40.01,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,- Sir, I can't. - Tucker, that's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.34,1:14:43.79,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,Hit me. Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:47.15,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,Come on, harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.08,1:14:50.99,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,- Better, sh'? - Yes, much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.65,1:14:55.63,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,I can see how people get a taste for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.12,1:15:00.43,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,I got a better idea. I'll shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.49,1:15:02.16,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.29,1:15:04.30,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,- Die, Vortex scum! - Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.17,1:15:11.70,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,Agent Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.17,1:15:16.67,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,It's Johnny English.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:21.01,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,Bag him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.73,1:15:39.64,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,The glass can withstand mortar attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.03,1:15:41.12,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,The door's one-way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.98,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,You can get out, but no one gets in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.03,1:15:44.34,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.01,1:15:50.75,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,You ready, Slater?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.98,1:16:00.16,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,I'll have them send refreshments to your room
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.22,1:16:01.42,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,when you're ready, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.52,1:16:03.09,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,Thank you, Agent One.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.50,1:16:14.57,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.27,1:16:19.11,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.07,1:16:22.88,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,Let me see your ID.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.21,1:16:26.12,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,- Excuse me - What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.55,1:16:30.75,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.02,1:16:34.96,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,Warning, this is a designated conflict zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.53,1:16:46.20,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,Sir? Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.65,1:17:04.25,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,Thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.25,1:17:06.49,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,You're welcome, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.15,1:17:08.46,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.56,1:17:21.41,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,Go on. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.17,1:17:30.48,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.08,1:17:40.29,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,Sir? Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:44.30,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,- English! - Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.66,1:17:48.10,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,They're going to make you kill Xiang Ping!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.16,1:17:49.47,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.53,1:17:54.31,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,Agent One, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.63,1:17:56.36,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,He won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.36,1:17:59.81,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,He's the third member of Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.87,1:18:01.85,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,Aren't you, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.38,1:18:08.15,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,Here to give you some Timoxy bubby...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.21,1:18:10.19,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,Timoxy bubby...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.85,1:18:14.56,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,Timoxy bubby...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.79,1:18:18.80,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,To give you a drug
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.81,1:18:22.03,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,that will make you obey his every command.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.63,1:18:32.48,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,I'm intrigued, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:38.05,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,How exactly were you going to administer it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.91,1:18:44.55,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,By injection?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.59,1:18:53.09,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,Some hideous gas through the air vents?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.43,1:19:01.84,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,Or by spiking her drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.40,1:19:06.51,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,Timoxeline Barbebutenol.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.94,1:19:16.25,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,He'll enter the manic phase any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.45,1:19:18.46,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,I have to warn you that
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.46,1:19:20.52,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,I've been trained to resist this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.09,1:19:25.86,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,You swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.02,1:19:28.70,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,Agent One, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:31.37,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,He's quite harmless at this phase.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:33.70,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,The drug will kill him, but just before it does,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:35.10,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,there'll be a short window
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.10,1:19:37.11,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,where he'll do everything I tell him to.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.44,1:19:46.55,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,Poor Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.88,1:19:49.62,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,You were never really Ml-7, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.71,1:19:51.95,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,You were never really one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.05,1:19:55.39,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,Now you're about to become our most famous agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.56,1:20:07.06,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,You'll now do exactly as I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.13,1:20:09.91,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,You are a traitor to the Service and to your country.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.97,1:20:11.50,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,Shut her up, old chap.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.00,1:20:15.24,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,- Duck. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.08,1:20:19.58,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.51,1:20:23.08,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,Okay, Slater. Let's get him ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.08,1:20:27.43,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.25,1:20:29.57,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,Premier Ping,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.57,1:20:31.20,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,it's a pleasure to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.59,1:20:34.00,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,You had a pleasant flight, I trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.43,1:20:37.43,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,I was just asking the Premier if he had a pleasant flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.93,1:20:42.43,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,Kate, Johnny's back on the team.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.53,1:20:43.84,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.93,1:20:44.54,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,It's all checked out
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:46.51,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,and the PM and the Chinese have approved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.60,1:20:48.51,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,- Approved what? - He's standing in for Pamela.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.61,1:20:50.68,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.22,1:21:04.56,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Agent Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.13,1:21:13.20,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,Good, good. And your wife is well?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.47,1:21:20.14,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,Lock it up, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.24,1:21:21.65,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.31,1:21:24.72,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.22,1:21:36.05,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,Premier, I am most grateful
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.05,1:21:38.76,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,you have agreed to meet me at this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.56,1:21:47.41,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,It is our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.33,1:21:49.57,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,Maintain that tone, Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.67,1:21:51.44,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,Avoid confrontation, keep eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.84,1:21:55.18,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,I can assure you that the Chinese people
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.27,1:21:59.51,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,have always regarded the British people
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.51,1:22:00.28,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,as completely horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.18,1:22:04.09,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,- Honourable. - Honourable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:07.53,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,Completely honourable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.35,1:22:09.76,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.42,1:22:13.37,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,I was very keen to meet...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.64,1:22:34.56,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,Johnny, stand up and go to the water table.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.55,1:22:43.05,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,Premier, I believe the present danger
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.15,1:22:44.89,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,can be averted if we act swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.99,1:22:47.06,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,Go to your right pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.73,1:22:52.80,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,We designed it for Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.90,1:22:55.57,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,Well, it's too bloody late now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.24,1:23:00.34,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,Just act natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.18,1:23:16.32,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,- Prime Minister, traditionally... - Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.42,1:23:18.99,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,...China does not respond well to advice...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.09,1:23:20.76,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,Pull out the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.43,1:23:26.77,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,Now, Johnny, I want you to kill Xiang Ping.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.03,1:23:31.88,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,Oh, dear God, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.61,1:23:36.02,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,He's being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.11,1:23:37.55,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,By who?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.18,1:23:39.52,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,Ambrose.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.61,1:23:41.99,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,Shoot Xiang Ping!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.62,1:23:50.96,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,Mind must be master of the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.29,1:23:56.13,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,He's resisting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.46,1:24:00.64,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,His left hand is fighting the right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.40,1:24:06.97,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,Come on, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.01,1:24:09.48,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,If I can interrupt the frequency,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.57,1:24:11.52,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,I could stop Ambrose from communicating with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.99,1:24:30.70,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,English, stand up!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.00,1:24:42.18,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.61,1:24:47.38,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,He'll be dead in 50 seconds, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.18,1:24:51.39,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.18,1:24:53.35,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.35,1:24:56.13,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,- Pull the trigger! - I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.21,1:25:19.15,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,Listen to me, this is Simon Ambrose,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.24,1:25:22.05,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,and I order you to shoot Xiang Ping!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:27.05,*ENG,960,0,0,0,,Ten seconds, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.55,1:25:30.76,*ENG,961,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.50,1:25:43.14,*ENG,962,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.23,1:25:45.27,*ENG,963,0,0,0,,Time to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.74,1:25:51.08,*ENG,964,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.08,1:25:53.52,*ENG,965,0,0,0,,Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.10,1:26:20.21,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,His pulse is dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.30,1:26:21.71,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,Don't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.81,1:26:23.28,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,Come on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.15,1:27:10.42,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,Open your heart, English,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.42,1:27:12.43,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,and you shall be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.50,1:27:27.11,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.87,1:27:57.47,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.57,1:27:58.88,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,I was passing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.54,1:28:00.91,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.04,1:28:02.38,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,Tucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.64,1:28:05.05,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,Welcome back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.38,1:28:06.45,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.54,1:28:07.92,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,I won't kiss you, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.04,1:28:09.72,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.72,1:28:14.89,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,Where's Ambrose?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.83,1:28:28.43,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,English?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.57,1:28:30.77,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,Sir. What are you doing, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.90,1:28:35.28,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,Guideline 17-5: Never question a senior agent in the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.41,1:28:36.61,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.03,1:28:46.95,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.37,1:30:20.36,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,Ambrose' you five-star turd.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.24,1:30:47.37,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,Another balls-up, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.08,1:31:00.72,*ENG,988,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.77,1:31:26.41,*ENG,989,0,0,0,,It's all over, Ambrose.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.08,1:31:32.62,*ENG,990,0,0,0,,You can betray your country, you can cheat your friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.75,1:31:36.25,*ENG,991,0,0,0,,but you can't get away from Johnny English...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.67,1:31:54.62,*ENG,992,0,0,0,,So long, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.98,1:32:02.35,*ENG,993,0,0,0,,The D-7.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.28,1:32:05.45,*ENG,994,0,0,0,,The bulletproof shield!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.02,1:32:09.52,*ENG,995,0,0,0,,Hey! It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.95,1:32:11.99,*ENG,996,0,0,0,,It's the T-2, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.12,1:32:13.83,*ENG,997,0,0,0,,- Is he... - Oh, he's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.83,1:32:14.83,*ENG,998,0,0,0,,It's the T-2!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.29,1:32:17.50,*ENG,999,0,0,0,,Close it. Close ii!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.63,1:32:19.30,*ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Stupid thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.54,1:32:34.02,*ENG,1001,0,0,0,,Oh, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.65,1:32:41.06,*ENG,1002,0,0,0,,The T-2.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.99,1:32:48.40,*ENG,1003,0,0,0,,Tucker, you clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.85,1:33:10.09,*ENG,1004,0,0,0,,I couldn't be more delighted.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.18,1:33:12.25,*ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Vortex's paymasters have been arrested,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.35,1:33:13.85,*ENG,1006,0,0,0,,and China has expressed its
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.85,1:33:16.19,*ENG,1007,0,0,0,,gratitude to both Britain and the Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.69,1:33:19.22,*ENG,1008,0,0,0,,We owe English a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.53,1:33:26.91,*ENG,1009,0,0,0,,Well, reinstating his knighthood is a truly lovely gesture.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.03,1:33:28.41,*ENG,1010,0,0,0,,And it will mean the world to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.87,1:33:32.90,*ENG,1011,0,0,0,,Her Majesty will be with him shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.62,1:34:20.75,*ENG,1012,0,0,0,,Gotcha! Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.00,1:34:34.34,*ENG,1013,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.43,1:34:40.64,*ENG,1014,0,0,0,,Just about had enough of you, you old cow!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.70,1:34:43.65,*ENG,1015,0,0,0,,You're going nowhere! Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.71,1:34:44.81,*ENG,1016,0,0,0,,English!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.87,1:34:47.50,*ENG,1017,0,0,0,,It's her! It's the killer cleaner! Finally,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.50,1:34:49.19,*ENG,1018,0,0,0,,I've got her!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.71,1:34:54.79,*ENG,1019,0,0,0,,You never know when it's over, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.85,1:34:59.73,*ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Well, it's over, over, over, over, over!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.20,1:38:36.01,*ENG,1021,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.07,1:38:37.61,*ENG,1022,0,0,0,,I'd love a take-away.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.01,1:38:41.35,*ENG,1023,0,0,0,,Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:51.93,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,(约翰尼·英格力士)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:04.93,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:10.24,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,五年前 他是我们最好的特工
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:13.88,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,对 要不是他在莫桑比克惹了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:18.88,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,(军情七处一团糟)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:23.88,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,(卫生部-莫桑比克 军情七处在非洲的大灾难)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.29,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,难道非他不可吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:33.09,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,线人只肯跟他接头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:35.92,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.93,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,他现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:12.60,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,你来这儿是为了抛开耻辱的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.60,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,(西藏群山)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.43,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,但你的重生之路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:20.64,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,实非易事 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:29.58,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,我们的目标很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:33.08,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,就是化弱为强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.53,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,化软为硬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:55.38,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,这一切都需要时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:05.02,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,意志是身体的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:13.52,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,顽强的意志 何惧上刀山下火海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:18.80,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,集中精神 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:23.37,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,什么 烫烫烫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.04,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,你虽青春不再
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:36.21,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,但姜还是老的辣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:04:00.04,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,若然意志能控制好身体
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:03.75,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,你定能重出江湖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:13.86,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,大师 我前路何如
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:19.76,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,我和更高层联系过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:35.24,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,军情七处希望你搭最快的航班回伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:45.25,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,大师 我准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.89,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,为时尚早
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.62,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,靠窗还是走道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.92,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,(旅客: 英格力士 | 座位号: 6A 靠窗)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:04:59.92,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,(目的地: 伦敦 | 出发地: 西藏)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.39,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,(红海)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:09.29,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,(索马里)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.10,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,(突尼斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.00,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,(扫描中)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.47,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,(目的地: 伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:44.92,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,(东芝 英国情报局)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.95,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,请稍等 先生 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.36,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,东芝英国情报局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:55.53,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,需要电子产品请按一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.96,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,连线特工请按二
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:01.33,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,当然 先生 麻烦您重新输入我们的网址好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.39,0:06:04.89,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,www.spyingforyou.gov.uk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.56,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,东芝英国情报局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.57,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,先生 早上好 有什么能帮助您的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.63,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.21,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,帕加索斯在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.04,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,请看镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:21.98,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,别笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.98,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,《憨豆特工2》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.23,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,帕姆拉·桑顿 军情七处的总管
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.16,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:33.83,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.73,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,你走了有一段时间了 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.01,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,我们可没忘记你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.61,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:49.07,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,这里还常说起你在莫桑比克的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:55.69,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,军情七处从你走后又进步了许多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.23,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,什么枪战 飞车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.95,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,沙文主义那一套 都过时了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:05.12,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,坦白说 我不乐意看到你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:08.20,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,你就是我要改革的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:11.37,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,可惜这事我做不了主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.76,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,总有些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.20,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,人会和明智的抉择背道而驰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.11,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,我们有个新情况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.87,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:28.31,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,这有只乖猫咪 有只乖猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:34.12,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,这有只乖猫咪 她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.56,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,- 我很意外 - 她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:39.13,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,菲白从不让陌生人抱它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.06,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,在动物世界里 我总能获得特权
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:44.33,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,这有只乖猫咪 我知道 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:47.14,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,谁是小可爱 小可爱是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:49.90,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,谁...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.48,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,我们都是小可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:03.08,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,凯特·萨姆纳 行为治疗师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:04.75,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,久仰您的大名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.69,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,想必都是盛赞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.99,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,跟我说说 萨姆纳女士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:13.26,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,行为治疗师的工作是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:17.70,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,观察深层心理的外在表象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.61,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,我们读人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.68,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,找时间聚聚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:26.10,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,你肯定会觉得我是本好书
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:43.39,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,帕加索斯 说说现况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:47.19,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,前中情局特工提图斯·费舍尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.63,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,从香港联系我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.96,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,他的情报显示 有人要在下周的中英会谈时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:54.06,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,暗杀中国总理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:57.63,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,需要你去弄清他确切的情报内容
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:00.81,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,既然如此 帕加索斯 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.81,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,一号特工会在楼下见你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:12.42,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,结果 我就爬上墙头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.56,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,把那鬼地方炸成平地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:15.94,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,一小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.15,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,我已经手拿鸡尾酒坐在酒吧里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:21.40,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,跟你们说 那也是相当惬意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.59,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.27,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,你好 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:31.03,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.71,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,春风得意啊 不过你一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.10,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 你走了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:36.84,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:40.41,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,五年三个月又六天 左右吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.01,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,当然 莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:48.19,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,那可当真是一团糟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:51.05,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,快来 给你打扮打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.03,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,欢迎来到玩具专柜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:06.54,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,我可不会把号码给你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:07.74,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,你知道帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.71,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,帕奇·柯特蒙就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.81,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:13.04,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,不用起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.48,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,想起也起不来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:20.08,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,测试B-6爆炸鞋时炸掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.72,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,很抱歉 还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:24.59,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,只能握这只手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.59,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,D-10爆炸门铃把它炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:32.40,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:36.84,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,这轮椅很不错 最高时速六十英里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:40.11,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,我还添了点小零件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.75,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,这边 我可没时间耗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:47.92,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,别按
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:51.46,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,别瞎捣乱好吧 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:52.99,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,她在这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.76,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,劳斯莱斯幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:59.19,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,应该说劳斯莱斯自动版
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:01.50,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,装甲钢板 还有好多小玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.86,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,说句"发动"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:05.63,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,- 发动 - 命令接受
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:09.30,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,语音激活只识别你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.30,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,劳斯莱斯提供了一个实验引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:16.61,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,九公升的V16 车速如风
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:19.38,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,但却更安静
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.72,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:22.98,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,再看这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.62,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,这些是你去香港的装备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:28.79,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,- 要来了 - 卫星接收器
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.13,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,跟踪装置 塑料炸弹口香糖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.32,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.97,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,那是新P2数字镖枪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:43.55,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,先生们 友情提醒一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:47.24,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,军情七处最新精配武器纯属扯淡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:50.65,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,我们最喜欢你严肃的样子 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:56.65,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,英格力士 你今晚去香港
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:58.81,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,费舍尔会联系你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.48,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,为了确保按章办事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:06.02,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,我会派人跟着你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:07.19,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,特工塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.53,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,十分荣幸 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:16.67,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,有人帮忙提行李很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:21.44,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,你以前可闹出过笑话 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.35,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,别给我添乱 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:26.21,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,完全明白 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.39,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,和当年一样吧 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.93,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,我要去瑞士 等你回来再说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.13,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,乐意之至 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:47.37,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,有人看到变声旅游喉糖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.55,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,没 没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.95,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,(香港)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.35,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,(娱乐场)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.65,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,(新葡京娱乐场 澳门)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:18.65,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.27,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,快点 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.78,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,九月我才满二十一岁 不可以进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.78,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,塔克 你可是女王特勤局的特工呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.62,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,要像个特工的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:52.10,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,换一千美元筹码 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.27,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:58.34,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,麻烦给张收据
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.32,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,注意找线人 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:11.22,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,要找戴眼镜的中国人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.16,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,再来一杯吗 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:18.46,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,长官 戴眼镜的中国人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.46,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,- 再来一杯啤酒 - 买定离手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:26.29,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,线人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.97,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:57.93,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,你奶奶生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:59.16,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:03.54,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,你奶奶生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:06.67,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,她真病得不轻 死很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.79,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,他死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.86,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.86,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,(九龙天堂 八号)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.38,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,- 嗨 妈妈 - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.25,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,没没没 没什么大事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:56.55,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,昨晚有点不舒服 现在没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.60,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,你手上有什么消息
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:06.78,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,幕后黑手要杀中国总理向平
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.07,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,这个组织叫旋风组
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.40,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:13.07,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,雇佣刺客 最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.28,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,快点 费舍尔 我要的是名字 是证据
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.69,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,旋风组有件秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.53,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,拿到它需要集齐三把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.67,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,我手上有一把
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.79,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,没了这钥匙 旋风组就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:41.30,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.77,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,这是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.17,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:48.38,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,我们是旋风三人组
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:54.79,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,别吹了 费舍尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:57.92,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,你 雇佣杀手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.86,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,就凭你那破枪法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.22,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,什么旋风
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:07.06,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,这词肯定是从洗衣粉盒上看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.36,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,旋风组当时也在莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:12.70,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.36,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,是 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:19.17,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,妈 妈妈 我得挂了 挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:21.71,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,那一整天我们都在呢 小约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.54,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,- 打扰了 长官 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.68,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,长官 这...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:30.42,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,快点 快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.66,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,女士 我来帮你提
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:47.60,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,来 对 我想你该离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.68,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,这里有危险人物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.07,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.38,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,抓住她 塔克 抓住她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:13.12,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.64,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,长官 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:29.41,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,这里 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.78,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,跟丢了 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:33.11,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,看我找到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:40.42,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,这里 长官 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:44.46,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,你到街上去 我到楼顶去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:25.67,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,你虽青春不再 但姜还是老的辣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:49.25,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,交出来 猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:18.25,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,(三号电梯)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.51,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,快点 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.28,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,需要我帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.76,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,我以女王的名义征用这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.95,0:22:01.48,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,遵命 中校
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:03.69,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,太刺激了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.48,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,喜欢喝点什么 我给您拿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:28.98,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,有伏特加和朗姆酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:34.38,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,您的安全是我们的首要任务
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.12,0:22:38.86,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,想更好地配合我们的工作 请看这份传单
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.74,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,薄荷甜酒 一点波尔图葡萄酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:45.80,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,我想这不错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:50.84,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,我是雪莉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.73,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,你好 雪莉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:23:00.65,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,往左一点 雪莉 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:45.23,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,干得好 中校
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:46.23,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.23,0:23:49.83,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,你碰到火柴棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:27.97,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 长官 - 就像角斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:56.02,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,快点 打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:24.96,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,干得好 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.17,0:25:46.71,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,再来点香槟 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:48.08,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,当然 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.18,0:25:50.42,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,塔克 你确定不来点香蒂酒之类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:53.82,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,我得完成任务报告呢 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:56.52,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,我们一着陆 帕加索斯就要见我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.05,0:25:59.43,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,任务报告
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.65,0:26:01.86,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,别写了 塔克 人生苦短啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:05.67,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,得学会品尝胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.73,0:26:07.50,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,努力工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:11.50,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,痛快玩乐 不是吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.73,0:26:13.84,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,芭芭拉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.05,0:26:33.59,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,旋风组完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:36.03,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,但至少
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:36.62,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,多年来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:39.80,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,我一直觉得莫桑比克的事是我的过错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.76,0:26:44.73,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,现在我知道不全是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.37,0:26:47.87,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,在莫桑比克到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.08,0:27:01.72,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,打扰了 先生 就要着陆了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:03.89,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,我帮您放到架子上好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.16,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:10.93,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,长官 我不觉得他会叫"苏珊"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:14.33,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,你不是语言学家吧 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.43,0:27:18.64,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,不是"苏珊" 是"书山"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:21.09,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,来自忻州地区
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.09,0:27:23.18,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,除非是我大错特错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.07,0:27:25.78,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,谢谢 书山
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:43.13,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,外交部长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:46.36,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,希望你有所收获 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.46,0:27:48.60,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,首相对此极为关心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.80,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,必须的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.13,0:27:54.20,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,有人密谋杀害中国总理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:58.81,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,策划者是一群残忍的杀手组成的旋风组
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.81,0:28:00.94,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.01,0:28:04.01,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,警报已经解除了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.98,0:28:08.36,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,因为我们得到了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:15.49,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.49,0:28:16.69,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:20.30,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,这东西很小巧是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:25.90,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,世事往往是四两拨千斤
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:29.67,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,- 正如大卫用卵石杀了哥利亚 - 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:32.60,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,当我拥有了这把小巧钥匙时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:35.85,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,强大的旋风组已经被扼杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.37,0:29:02.61,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,书山
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.87,0:29:05.87,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,是苏珊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:12.25,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,拿到钥匙了 可费舍尔泄密了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:18.09,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,明白 我们会干掉英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:24.43,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,你还得再打扫一下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:28.87,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 大黄先生在这
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:31.54,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,伊兹 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:33.94,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,为什么不把他带暖房里去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.21,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,我等会就来陪你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:37.81,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,好的 快点 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:39.82,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,- 走吗 - 快点 大黄先生
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:44.45,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,等你找你的钥匙 给我打个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.54,0:29:46.58,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,很抱歉 外长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:48.55,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,本来想能给您带来更多好信息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.96,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:25.93,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,帕加索斯 我抓到她了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.62,0:30:27.69,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,过来 你个女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.79,0:30:28.82,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.92,0:30:32.46,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,她就是在香港的那个杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.59,0:30:34.09,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,她是我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:37.84,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,会不会是双面娇娃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:44.81,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.77,0:30:47.81,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,我给你倒杯茶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:53.45,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,- 你会没事的 妈妈 - 那人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:58.33,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,按她说的 上杯茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.62,0:31:06.73,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,帕加索斯 真的真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:09.67,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,别跟我道歉 跟她说去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.38,0:31:26.98,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,再抱歉不过了 帕加索斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:31.66,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,我想我弄错身份了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:33.83,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,现在 我完全明白
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.89,0:31:35.83,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,你很难受 但我希望也许你...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:42.90,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:47.61,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,塔克 是她 香港的杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:50.44,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,- 不 不是她 长官 - 是她 绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:53.52,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,- 不是 长官 - 绝对是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.01,0:32:02.36,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:04.19,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.25,0:32:07.36,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,你这个残忍的老母羊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:12.03,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,奶奶 他在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.76,0:32:14.07,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,我打 我打
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.86,0:32:17.71,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:21.24,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:24.72,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,这次抓住她了 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:29.08,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,她就是为旋风组服务的女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:31.59,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,还没打够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:33.45,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,- 英格力士 - 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:46.66,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,你在外交部长面前羞辱我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:48.42,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,弄丢了旋风组唯一的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.23,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,现在还想杀我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.30,0:32:52.57,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,两次
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.57,0:32:55.46,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,帕加索斯 我们另有线索
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:57.11,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,旋风组在莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.24,0:33:00.45,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,他们应该对昌巴尔总统的死负责
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.57,0:33:04.58,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,不 你才该对昌巴尔总统的死负责
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:19.29,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,你完全抢了小丑先生的风头
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:25.77,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,不过 至少我们知道旋风组当时就在莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.43,0:33:28.71,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,当你告诉帕加索斯的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:32.01,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,表现出了说实话的四大特征
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:41.99,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,这是个面部动作编码系统
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.62,0:33:46.15,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,它的高速摄像镜头可以捕捉到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.29,0:33:47.82,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,肉眼看不到的微表情
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:50.16,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,探察到所谓的情感泄露
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.29,0:33:54.17,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,萨姆纳女士 我是训练有素的特工 决不泄密
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:57.30,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,我想让你重返莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.67,0:34:00.41,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,有这个必要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:03.98,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.74,0:34:07.91,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,我想让你重返莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.74,0:34:12.38,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:14.65,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,这算不算泄密呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.98,0:34:16.25,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,好了 开工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.25,0:34:19.33,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,非工作时间来这 我可是冒了险
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:21.89,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,如果旋风组当时在莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:23.20,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,你可能看到些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:26.20,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,我会通过催眠让你回到当时的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.33,0:34:27.40,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.40,0:34:30.10,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,你可以省了这些时髦把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.10,0:34:33.00,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,英格力士先生 拜托 我是专业人士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:34.50,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,我不会随便打个响指
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:38.35,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,让你说出映入脑海的第一件事物
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.44,0:34:39.94,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,蓬松的枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.04,0:34:41.71,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:45.58,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,聪慧的头脑 美丽的面庞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:47.02,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:50.69,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,我完全攀不上的美女
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.52,0:34:59.90,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,我现在要你回到莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.86,0:35:08.01,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,说说你看到了什么 约翰尼 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.80,0:35:11.65,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,昌巴尔总统的就职大典
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.31,0:35:15.05,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,没错 你是安保负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.71,0:35:19.75,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,一切都相当顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.88,0:35:22.05,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,今天 我们勇攀高峰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.22,0:35:23.99,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,英格力士特工
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:29.89,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,群众的呼声 我都听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.26,0:35:33.40,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,一个崭新的和平繁荣之邦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.49,0:35:36.67,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,备用电源被切断了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.90,0:35:41.94,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,没有切断 只是被关上了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.90,0:35:45.94,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,那你知道 怎么打开你的开关吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.77,0:35:49.91,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,我该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:54.25,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,这种任务总是相当棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.25,0:35:56.82,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,不过圆满完成后 我还是深感欣慰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:59.33,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,保护总统 舍我其谁
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:01.96,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,未来属于莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:04.09,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.94,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,开始放礼花了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.93,0:36:11.14,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,庆祝自由与欢呼喝彩之音
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:20.87,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,别紧张 约翰尼 放松 回想一下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:23.65,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,在洗按摩浴之前 你还看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:30.78,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.82,0:36:33.16,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,费舍尔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.99,0:36:37.30,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,和另外两个人在露台上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.39,0:36:41.46,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,是的 旋风组的三名成员那天都在场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.56,0:36:44.91,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,你看到谁了 都有谁 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:50.68,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,阿提姆·卡尔兰科
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.97,0:36:56.48,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,阿提姆·卡尔兰科 双重间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.58,0:36:59.32,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,曾受雇于莫斯科的军情七处
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:01.98,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,对于可能暴露他身份的人都格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.98,0:37:02.65,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,因此被遣退
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.58,0:37:05.65,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,五年前 他在这里现身
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:08.32,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,化名谢尔盖·普多夫金
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.42,0:37:10.20,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,他是个富豪 很有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:12.49,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,是奥克伍德顶级高尔夫俱乐部的会员
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.49,0:37:13.87,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,你就在那儿跟他见面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.99,0:37:16.75,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,他在那里参加比洞赛 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.75,0:37:18.97,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,我会把你设为他今天的比赛对手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.24,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,(比洞赛 上午10点30分, 彼特·亚当斯对战谢尔盖·普多夫金)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:25.01,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,搞定 你将化身彼特·亚当斯先生参加比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.61,0:37:29.09,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,谢了 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.24,0:37:32.61,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,如果卡尔兰科是旋风组的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.61,0:37:35.38,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,把他给我带回来 要活的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.47,0:38:02.48,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,是普丝巾先生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.88,0:38:06.62,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,是普多夫金 那你一定就是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:12.39,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,亚当斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:15.22,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,车很棒 亚当斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:17.13,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,我的劳斯莱斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:18.29,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,准备就绪 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.06,0:38:20.23,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.89,0:38:22.40,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.06,0:38:24.23,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:25.74,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,命令接受
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:30.48,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,那你从事什么行业呢 亚当斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.57,0:38:31.74,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,我叫普多夫金
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:35.31,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,抱歉 没错 我才叫亚当斯 你叫
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.41,0:38:37.91,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,你说的那个什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.01,0:38:39.92,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.75,0:38:45.92,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,不好意思 我以为自己忘了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.35,0:39:13.79,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,戴手套吧 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:17.12,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,塔克 虽然我不是打高尔夫的行家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.18,0:39:19.72,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,可还是能握好球杆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.21,0:39:47.66,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,好球 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.93,0:40:05.40,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,你做哪一行生意呢 普地精先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.50,0:40:08.57,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,我是做拆迁生意的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:14.21,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,我有个朋友也做拆迁买卖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:15.64,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,他叫提图斯·费舍尔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.64,0:40:17.95,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,你跟他有来往吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:22.12,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,我可警告你 亚当斯先生 别趟这浑水
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.62,0:40:25.03,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,因为一旦陷进去 可能就出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:27.19,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,谨记在心 普地精先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.29,0:40:30.10,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,劳驾 我叫普多夫金
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.94,0:40:45.21,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.07,0:40:48.71,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,事实上 就跟我的朋友费舍尔一样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.65,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,子弹从身后穿进
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:55.82,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,偏偏还是他的清洁工干的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.89,0:41:05.10,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,不过他们也没抢什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.76,0:41:06.83,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,就拿了把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.77,0:41:16.47,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,赛点 我觉得可以从左往右打
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.57,0:41:17.78,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.23,0:41:19.13,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.26,0:41:42.76,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,在树林那边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:48.18,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.17,0:41:52.62,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 他不能死 绝对不能
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:54.71,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,带他离开这儿 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:42:00.32,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,长官 他看起来不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.31,0:42:04.89,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,我们带你去医院 你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:08.36,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,你会开这玩意儿吧 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.45,0:42:10.70,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,- 这是基础训练之一 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.79,0:42:12.63,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,跟骑自行车没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.87,0:42:21.47,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,对 我全记起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:47.26,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,这里是祖鲁祖鲁探戈高尔夫酒店的直升机
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.36,0:42:48.83,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,机上有一位伤员
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.83,0:42:50.77,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,请指示最近的医院地址
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.86,0:42:52.17,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,请说你们的具体位置
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:53.61,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,位置 我们的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.23,0:42:56.58,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,她打坏了导航系统
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.05,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.58,0:43:11.43,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,- 兰斯多克 - 我们在兰斯多克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:12.62,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,飞行高度是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.72,0:43:14.60,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,飞行高度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.42,0:43:18.46,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,大约18英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.09,0:43:21.57,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,喂 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.30,0:43:26.24,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,抱歉 马上开走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.23,0:43:29.87,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.94,0:43:33.54,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,我们得沿着路开 就走1328道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.61,0:43:35.14,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,鼎汉一定有医院
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.24,0:43:37.28,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,(鼎汉)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:44.05,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,看看他 塔克 去看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:52.18,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,我觉得他不行了 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.18,0:43:53.73,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,不行也得行 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.79,0:43:57.43,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,他是我们唯一的线索 再想别的辙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.07,0:44:06.57,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,不要就此放弃 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.64,0:44:12.65,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,上帝知道一路走来的疲惫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.58,0:44:23.83,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,我们都是 天使和梦想家
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.36,0:44:30.17,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,不要就此放弃 我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.76,0:44:34.27,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,我们定会战胜困难与艰辛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.15,0:44:53.19,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,看啊 长官 跟着那辆急救车
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.29,0:44:54.79,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.40,0:45:07.17,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,长官 长官 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.74,0:45:13.18,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,卡尔兰科 卡尔兰科
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.38,0:45:22.09,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,这是第二把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.65,0:45:29.42,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,旋风组的成员 一个是克格勃的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.42,0:45:35.23,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,- 是 - 一个是中情局的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:37.57,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,是 还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:46.55,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,一个是军情七处的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.18,0:45:57.13,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,难以置信 军情七处竟然有内魂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.75,0:46:01.56,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,应该是内鬼 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.52,0:46:03.86,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.29,0:46:06.46,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,军情七处有个内鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:09.70,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,有个内魂还有个内鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.30,0:46:13.74,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,不是的 长官 有一个内鬼 不是内魂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.47,0:46:16.91,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,我不同意 肯定有个内魂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:18.74,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,证据确凿 毋庸置疑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.80,0:46:22.41,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,但你刚刚说可能还有个内鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.24,0:46:25.45,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,是帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.91,0:46:30.62,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,首相要来军情七处开会
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.81,0:46:36.22,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,(军情七处总部 1012室 17点45分)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.22,0:46:40.00,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,再看这里 眼神向下再向左 表示不同意
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:42.43,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,通过向平的眼睛 便知道他的内心活动
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.43,0:46:43.30,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆纳女士
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:46.14,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,如果会晤继续的话 希望你也能出席
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.73,0:46:48.41,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,好的 首相大人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:51.34,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,先生们 晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.44,0:46:52.85,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,- 你好 英格力士先生 - 你好 萨姆纳女士
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.61,0:46:56.81,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.14,0:46:59.47,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,那咱们的首相大人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.47,0:47:02.46,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,要何时大驾光临呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.82,0:47:04.59,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,我就是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.68,0:47:06.63,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,就你 少做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.30,0:47:19.54,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,好吧 那么人齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.17,0:47:26.12,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,这次与中国首脑的会晤非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.17,0:47:27.52,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,东南亚那些蛮夷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.61,0:47:29.88,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,已经在秘密开发核武
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.98,0:47:32.85,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,所以 与中国达成共识很关键
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.95,0:47:35.79,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,一般而言 中国不会支持我们的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.85,0:47:38.12,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,但我相信 要是时机恰当
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.18,0:47:41.83,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,向平有能力并愿意协助我们解除危机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.95,0:47:44.37,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,鉴于他对西方的友好态度
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:46.23,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,我们还是有机会的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.33,0:47:50.06,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,但要保证他的安全 这次会晤才能继续
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:52.50,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,我认为 安保得当就没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.50,0:47:55.57,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,如果旋风组在密谋行动 那就很危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.67,0:47:58.55,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,我也同意 首相
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:02.18,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,我有个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.21,0:48:06.52,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,瑞士政府同意把空中堡垒借给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.52,0:48:09.22,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,那是他们在阿尔卑斯山脉的军事要塞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.22,0:48:13.72,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,一座非常优秀的高地工事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.82,0:48:16.66,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,可谓坚不可摧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:20.19,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,这样就能解决我们的安全问题
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.99,0:48:22.84,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,那么会晤将继续进行
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:25.00,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,帕姆拉 我希望你多温习普通话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.20,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,到时你和这里最好的特工
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.20,0:48:28.77,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,会紧随我左右
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.87,0:48:30.71,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,好的 首相大人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.67,0:48:35.02,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,旋风组这边调查的怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.18,0:48:37.25,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.88,0:48:39.64,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,旋风组是个三人组
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.64,0:48:42.88,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,一个是费舍尔 一个是卡尔兰科
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.02,0:48:46.90,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,而卡尔兰科今天被那第三个人杀害了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.09,0:48:49.57,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,有什么线索吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.69,0:48:51.86,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,有 但需要时间调查
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.92,0:48:53.77,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.86,0:48:58.04,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,我们需要知道旋风组第三名成员的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.24,0:49:05.04,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,给我一天的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:18.13,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,再来一瓶罗曼尼康帝
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.05,0:49:20.96,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,没问题 您需要什么甜点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.05,0:49:23.09,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,是的 就点你这甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.92,0:49:27.10,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,那我也要分杯羹
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.90,0:49:33.64,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.90,0:49:41.25,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,说吧 约翰尼 你想问我什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.78,0:49:50.16,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,西蒙 你认识这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.80,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,有点像把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.92,0:49:58.59,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,卡尔兰科和费舍尔各有一把
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:50:01.43,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,也都因此而被杀害了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.33,0:50:06.71,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,那我拿去给实验室的哥们看看再...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.80,0:50:13.15,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,卡尔兰科告诉我 第三个人就在军情七处里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.68,0:50:23.32,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,那你相信他说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.98,0:50:30.49,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,西蒙 我必须要当着你的面问清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.79,0:50:37.14,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,你觉得这个人会是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.83,0:50:43.30,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,约翰尼 我还以为你在怀疑我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:44.81,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,怎么会 当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:48.81,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 西蒙·安布罗斯 邪恶的大反派
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.87,0:50:50.82,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,- 快别说了 - 我们中的大叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.88,0:50:52.32,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,你啊 你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.01,0:50:55.69,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,西蒙 你太幽默了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.08,0:50:58.49,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,快笑抽了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.82,0:51:01.02,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:04.59,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,(塔克: 快来洗手间 十万火急)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.59,0:51:07.20,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,不好意思 失陪一下 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.17,0:51:23.24,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 塔克 你就不能等等吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.34,0:51:25.05,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,长官 是安布罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.68,0:51:27.42,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道是安布罗斯 我正和他吃饭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.51,0:51:30.19,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,不是 他就是旋风组的第三个人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.88,0:51:33.86,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,西蒙·安布罗斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.00,0:51:37.56,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,他可是伊顿公学的高材生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.69,0:51:40.97,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.06,0:51:42.20,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.30,0:51:46.37,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,- 你这是干什 - 过去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.47,0:51:48.57,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,- 好 好 - 快点 过去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.70,0:51:50.37,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:54.74,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,- 你说你根本不认识卡尔兰科 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.87,0:51:57.41,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,那你如何解释这张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.04,0:52:00.25,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,我潜入了卡尔兰科的计算机
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.25,0:52:02.05,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,这是你们俩在莫桑比克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.18,0:52:33.09,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,我有时也不能淋漓尽致 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.76,0:52:53.61,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,你就是旋风组的 你是旋风组的第三个人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.70,0:52:54.87,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,塔克 这太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.14,0:52:58.05,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,抱歉 我马上解决
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.37,0:53:00.11,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,没错 我当时在莫桑比克
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.04,0:53:02.31,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.78,0:53:06.12,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,但我是因为帕奇·柯特蒙才去的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.18,0:53:10.02,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,帕奇吗 抱歉 马上就好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.12,0:53:12.99,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,他才是你要抓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.49,0:53:15.62,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,- 少糊弄我 - 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.62,0:53:19.12,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,军情七处为了逮捕他专门建了个秘密组织
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.12,0:53:21.83,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,我就是其中一员
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.70,0:53:24.68,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,秘密组织里的秘密组织吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.80,0:53:27.18,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,是吗 那这个组织叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:29.80,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,到底叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.24,0:53:31.34,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,(阿米蒂奇·香克斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.64,0:53:32.98,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,阿米蒂奇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.21,0:53:36.81,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,一个叫阿米蒂奇的秘密的秘密的秘密行动组织
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.21,0:53:39.52,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,我们直接听命于首相
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.85,0:53:44.16,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,太离奇了吧 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.68,0:53:46.03,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,事实就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.15,0:53:49.36,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,你难道真的认为
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.49,0:53:54.56,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,我会相信你这套不靠谱的胡诌乱扯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:56.10,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 塔克
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.10,0:53:57.90,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,果真是本月特工之星
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.00,0:54:01.21,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,- 谢谢夸奖 长官 - 来 把枪给我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.33,0:54:02.54,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,好了 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.67,0:54:06.62,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你才是胡诌乱扯的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.71,0:54:09.52,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,你脑子里真是团浆糊 孩子 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.58,0:54:13.05,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,不 我不走 长官 他在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.18,0:54:16.46,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,我对你很失望 军情处对你很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.55,0:54:18.62,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,说实话 你也应该对自己感到失望
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.72,0:54:21.39,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,- 但我 - 快给我离开
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.26,0:54:29.93,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,帕奇·柯特蒙 怎么会是他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.93,0:54:31.40,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,他炸掉了自己的双腿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.53,0:54:34.53,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,这就是我说的深藏不露
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.60,0:54:36.44,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,想想我之前多佩服他
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.54,0:54:37.61,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,他讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.57,0:54:40.88,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 一直都是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.94,0:54:44.25,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,他觉得你就是个自大的无名小卒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.38,0:54:47.56,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,蠢蛋一只 根本不配待在军情七处
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.56,0:54:50.78,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,所以他才设计陷害你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.95,0:54:54.83,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,听着 约翰尼 千万不要因为他毁了你的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.92,0:54:55.95,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,你就失去理智
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.96,0:54:57.76,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,单枪匹马地去找他算账
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.43,0:55:04.07,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,我真不应该跟你说这番话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:08.07,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,晚安 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.13,0:55:10.25,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.25,0:55:13.61,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,我们可能要拿刚才那把钥匙去逮捕他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.58,0:55:21.99,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.62,0:55:24.99,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,傻帽
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.92,0:55:31.13,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.76,0:55:35.76,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,- 给我们和客户安排一个会议 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.62,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.81,0:55:53.62,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,知道第三个人是谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.32,0:55:58.30,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,就是约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.13,0:56:10.63,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,你好 帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.30,0:56:13.37,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,在请求宽恕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.63,0:56:20.48,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,都结束了 英格力士 你走投无路了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.97,0:56:23.58,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,是啊 你当然想 是不是 帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.68,0:56:27.99,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,毕竟我就是个自大的无名小卒而已
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.51,0:56:30.02,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.32,0:56:36.70,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,我知道你就是旋风组的第三名成员
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.33,0:56:43.03,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,不对 约翰尼 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.23,0:56:45.67,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,不 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.73,0:56:47.51,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,不 你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.33,0:56:51.51,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,所有特工就位
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.57,0:56:53.85,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,一切都到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.88,0:57:00.05,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.39,0:57:44.73,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.30,0:57:52.20,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,(车速: 快)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.80,0:57:57.94,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,干吗呢 看着点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.91,0:58:01.59,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.17,0:58:03.52,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,借过 借过
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.58,0:58:06.11,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,别让他跑了 快点快点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.28,0:58:07.42,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.29,0:58:24.33,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,向西驶入怀恩大街 调动一切车辆
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.85,0:58:37.02,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,(车速: 飞快)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.47,0:59:02.47,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,神经病
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.54,0:59:13.39,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,这都能跟丢 难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.36,0:59:29.84,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,嘿 你以为你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.57,1:00:09.77,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,让你跑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.90,1:00:28.33,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,(车速: 飞快)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.90,1:00:43.07,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,特工英格力士 停车 快停车
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.00,1:00:48.92,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,(车速: 极快)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.45,1:01:09.71,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,(睡眠模式)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.16,1:01:11.27,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.30,1:01:16.47,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,追
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.79,1:01:36.85,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,凯特 凯特
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.85,1:01:38.96,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,我不是旋风组的 我被陷害了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.03,1:01:42.37,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,你得相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.22,1:02:10.53,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,打算如何行动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.59,1:02:16.88,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,跟莫桑比克的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.88,1:02:18.60,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,单人行动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.07,1:02:21.41,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,人你选好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.07,1:02:23.67,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,我会决定的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.57,1:02:28.68,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,我在苏黎世的账户
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.68,1:02:31.58,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,五亿美元 按规矩
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:48.60,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,你晕过去好半天
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.04,1:03:03.71,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,所幸只是皮肉伤
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.78,1:03:06.15,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,听着 我今晚要去瑞士
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.16,1:03:08.16,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,我走了你可以待在这
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.05,1:03:11.61,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,我在查看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.61,1:03:14.33,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,昌巴尔遇刺那晚的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:17.32,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,有点蹊跷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.42,1:03:19.60,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,昌巴尔总统被刺之后的片刻
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.66,1:03:22.00,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,刺客突然倒地而死
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.09,1:03:25.34,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,尸检报告是心脏停跳
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.43,1:03:30.47,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,但如果你看一下内部闭路电视画面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:35.41,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,没事吧你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.94,1:03:37.58,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,很好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.61,1:03:40.68,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,来看看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.35,1:03:44.36,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,行刺的十五分钟前
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.36,1:03:46.99,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,他开始狂躁
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.09,1:03:49.76,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,他完全控制不了自己的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:52.83,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,然后 突然像是紧张性神经分裂症
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.33,1:03:56.97,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,这里 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.30,1:03:59.50,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,就这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.93,1:04:02.14,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,有人跟他说话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.94,1:04:09.78,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,我觉得他压根不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.84,1:04:12.34,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,我想旋风组组织的秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.11,1:04:16.35,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,就是一种能控制思维的药
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.45,1:04:18.83,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,只有一种药符合以上症状
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.22,1:04:24.46,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,地莫克西... 地莫克西林巴巴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.52,1:04:26.40,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,地莫克西林巴伯布特纳
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.96,1:04:30.30,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,中情局十年前命令将其销毁
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.36,1:04:33.81,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,负责处置它的特工是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:36.57,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,提图斯·费舍尔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.84,1:04:42.98,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,我对你无以为报
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:45.82,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,共进晚餐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.15,1:04:48.85,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:52.83,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,小门开了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.19,1:05:05.54,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,约翰尼 你打算怎么对付旋风组组织
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.03,1:05:11.71,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,不知道啊 如果西蒙在就有办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.77,1:05:14.25,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,你为什么觉着他比你强
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.87,1:05:16.88,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,他是个神人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.18,1:05:19.18,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,我更喜欢凡人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.11,1:05:24.79,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,单纯又难以捉摸 让人疯狂的凡人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.68,1:05:29.29,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,我才发现最让我心潮澎湃的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.39,1:05:32.75,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,是绝对的忠诚 决心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.75,1:05:34.43,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,和勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.93,1:05:39.10,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,你总是让我神魂颠倒 正中下怀
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.23,1:05:42.94,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,而你现在
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.74,1:05:49.58,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,萨姆纳小姐 你瞳孔在扩大
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.97,1:05:51.78,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,有吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.28,1:05:55.78,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,你两颊开始红润
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.15,1:05:58.42,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,秋波频送
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.78,1:06:00.66,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,心率加速
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.95,1:06:08.93,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,萨姆纳小姐 我觉着理性已经阻止不了我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.66,1:06:15.51,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,- 快去屋里 - 遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.17,1:06:17.41,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,赶紧啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.44,1:06:27.42,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.48,1:06:29.82,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,- 西蒙是你啊 - 凯特
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.42,1:06:32.95,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 我送你去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.02,1:06:35.66,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,真贴心 我去拿包
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.63,1:06:41.97,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,你自己吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.09,1:06:43.83,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,别 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.93,1:06:45.10,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,在工作呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.16,1:06:48.94,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,准备一下中国总理的资料 你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.00,1:06:50.84,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,我们在追查约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.54,1:06:58.99,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,关于旋风组我们有些事想问他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.04,1:07:00.68,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,我猜你没看见他吧 对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.78,1:07:01.85,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.96,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,没把他藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:08.96,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,像我做出来的事吗 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.36,1:07:53.40,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,安布罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.13,1:09:29.80,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,科林 有个亚当斯先生要见你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.43,1:09:34.17,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,- 塔克 - 你在这儿干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.27,1:09:37.18,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,你正被全国通缉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.27,1:09:38.68,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,我们猜安布罗斯是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:40.71,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,什么叫我们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.81,1:09:42.11,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,如果咱够快 还能...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.17,1:09:44.45,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,你能听句劝吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.51,1:09:47.39,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,你自以为什么都知道 狗屁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.48,1:09:50.29,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,当特工是我毕生梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:52.62,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,多亏你 我被停职了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.99,1:09:56.02,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,你们谁来点橙汁吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.12,1:09:58.00,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,- 不用 谢谢谢 - 免了 老妈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.12,1:10:03.61,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,小兄弟 安布罗斯在瑞士
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.61,1:10:05.47,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,我们责无旁贷
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.53,1:10:09.67,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,我来这儿 是因为国家需要我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.70,1:10:14.98,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,她也需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.23,1:10:36.93,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,- 劳斯莱斯 - 准备就绪 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.60,1:10:39.07,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.50,1:10:46.11,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,测得前方障碍
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.19,1:11:09.60,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,导航系统锁定瑞士 咱们起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.43,1:11:23.58,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,(时速216公里 违章)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.66,1:11:44.90,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,已经到达终点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.96,1:11:47.74,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,祝你好运 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.31,1:11:57.58,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,空中堡垒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.59,1:12:01.42,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,上下各只有一条路
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:06.63,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,来吧 准备一下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.59,1:12:15.37,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,看啊 T-2地对空导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.43,1:12:19.10,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,这是D-7防弹伞
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.04,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,好好学学 塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.13,1:12:24.01,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,我玩这些的时候你还不知道在哪儿捏泥巴呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.13,1:12:55.58,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,P-8倒抓钩
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.73,1:12:57.97,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.04,1:12:59.74,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,- 目测高度 - 十一米
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.84,1:13:01.34,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,交给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.41,1:13:03.25,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,我能说一句吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:07.18,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,真棒极了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.75,1:13:11.56,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.52,1:13:22.44,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,D-16攀爬器 看好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.33,1:13:24.86,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,你确定这是攀爬器吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.93,1:13:26.53,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,闭着眼睛都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.23,1:13:30.37,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,特工被困 特工被困
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.68,1:13:43.78,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,特工受困 特工受困
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.55,1:13:48.26,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.35,1:13:50.09,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.19,1:13:52.03,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:04.71,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,发射信号弹
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.77,1:14:08.24,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.17,1:14:13.32,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.25,1:14:16.88,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,四区有人闯入
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.55,1:14:27.16,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,我的天哪 别让我死在瑞士佬手里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.59,1:14:31.80,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,塔克 听着 你来打我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.90,1:14:33.50,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 一番争斗之后
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.60,1:14:37.41,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,你可以逮捕我 然后把我押进堡垒里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.47,1:14:40.01,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.34,1:14:43.79,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,打我啊 打我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:47.15,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,使劲儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.08,1:14:50.99,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,- 好点不 - 好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.65,1:14:55.63,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,看来还真有人有这癖好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.12,1:15:00.43,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,我有个更好的主意 我朝你开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.49,1:15:02.16,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.29,1:15:04.30,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,- 去死吧 旋风组的人渣 - 塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.17,1:15:11.70,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,特工塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.17,1:15:16.67,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,这是约翰尼·英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:21.01,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,装袋带走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.73,1:15:39.64,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,这玻璃连炮都轰不开
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.03,1:15:41.12,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,门能从里面反锁
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.12,1:15:42.98,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,你能出来但没人进得去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.03,1:15:44.34,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.01,1:15:50.75,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,斯莱特 好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.98,1:16:00.16,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,帕加索斯 你准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.22,1:16:01.42,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,我就让他们把饮料给你送进去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.52,1:16:03.09,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,谢谢你 特工一号
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.50,1:16:14.57,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,弟兄们 我来接手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.27,1:16:19.11,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,站那儿别动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.07,1:16:22.88,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,出示一下你的身份
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.21,1:16:26.12,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 这是什...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.55,1:16:30.75,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.02,1:16:34.96,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,看好了 这里是格斗区
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.53,1:16:46.20,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,长官 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.65,1:17:04.25,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.25,1:17:06.49,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,不客气 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.15,1:17:08.46,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.56,1:17:21.41,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,快喝 快喝
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.17,1:17:30.48,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.08,1:17:40.29,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,长官 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:44.30,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,- 英格力士 - 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.66,1:17:48.10,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,他们想让你行刺向平
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.16,1:17:49.47,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.53,1:17:54.31,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,一号特工 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.63,1:17:56.36,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,他不是来帮你的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.36,1:17:59.81,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,他是旋风组的第三号
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.87,1:18:01.85,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,对吧 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.38,1:18:08.15,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,他来是给你地莫克西...巴巴...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.21,1:18:10.19,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,地莫克西巴巴...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.85,1:18:14.56,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,地莫克西巴贝...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.79,1:18:18.80,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,给你一种药
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.81,1:18:22.03,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,让你服从他的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.63,1:18:32.48,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,我倒很想看看 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:38.05,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,你打算怎么实施呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.91,1:18:44.55,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,皮下注射
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.59,1:18:53.09,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,从通风口里吹气
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.43,1:19:01.84,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,难不成还从饮料下手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.40,1:19:06.51,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,地莫克西林巴伯布特纳
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.94,1:19:16.25,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,他现在随时有可能进入癫狂状态
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.45,1:19:18.46,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,你们可别忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.46,1:19:20.52,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,我对抵御这类事情可是千锤百炼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.09,1:19:25.86,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,你个猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.02,1:19:28.70,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,一号特工 什么情况
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:31.37,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,他现在没什么危害
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:33.70,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,他会被毒死 不过在那之前
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:35.10,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,有一小段空档
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.10,1:19:37.11,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,我说什么他做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.44,1:19:46.55,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,可怜的约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.88,1:19:49.62,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,你从来都不属于军情七处
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.71,1:19:51.95,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,从来就不是我们的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.05,1:19:55.39,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,而你现在却要成为最有名的特工了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.56,1:20:07.06,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,现在我说什么你做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.13,1:20:09.91,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,你是组织和国家的叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.97,1:20:11.50,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,让他闭嘴 老头
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.00,1:20:15.24,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,- 闪 - 啥
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.08,1:20:19.58,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,跟你说了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.51,1:20:23.08,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,斯莱特 让他做好准备
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.08,1:20:27.43,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,时刻准备着
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.25,1:20:29.57,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,总理
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.57,1:20:31.20,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,能得相见 不胜荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.59,1:20:34.00,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,旅途可曾安好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.43,1:20:37.43,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,我只是问总理他旅途是否安好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.93,1:20:42.43,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,凯特 约翰尼回归组织了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.53,1:20:43.84,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.93,1:20:44.54,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,查出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:46.51,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,首相和中国方面也证实了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.60,1:20:48.51,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,- 证实什么 - 他来顶替帕姆拉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.61,1:20:50.68,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,这不挺好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.22,1:21:04.56,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,打扰一下 塔克特工
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.13,1:21:13.20,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,好的 尊夫人可好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.47,1:21:20.14,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,约翰尼 把门锁了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.24,1:21:21.65,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.31,1:21:24.72,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.22,1:21:36.05,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,总理 我很感谢您能在
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.05,1:21:38.76,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,这个时候同我见面
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.56,1:21:47.41,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,是我荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.33,1:21:49.57,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,保持这种语调 首相
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.67,1:21:51.44,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,避免对抗 保持眼神交流
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.84,1:21:55.18,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.27,1:21:59.51,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,中国人民一向认为贵国人民
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.51,1:22:00.28,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,十分神经
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.18,1:22:04.09,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,- 尊敬 - 尊敬
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:07.53,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,十分值得尊敬
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.35,1:22:09.76,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.42,1:22:13.37,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,我很想见到...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.64,1:22:34.56,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,约翰尼 站起来 走到饮品桌边上
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.55,1:22:43.05,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,总理 我相信只要及时行动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.15,1:22:44.89,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,当下的危险是可以避免的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.99,1:22:47.06,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,伸手掏右口袋
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.73,1:22:52.80,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,这是为帕加索斯设计的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.90,1:22:55.57,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,现在太特么晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.24,1:23:00.34,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,表现得尽量自然
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.18,1:23:16.32,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,- 首相 传统意义上讲... - 不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.42,1:23:18.99,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,...中国并不十分接纳...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.09,1:23:20.76,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,拔出枪管
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.43,1:23:26.77,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,约翰尼 现在我让你杀掉向平
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.03,1:23:31.88,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,天哪 不
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.61,1:23:36.02,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,他被控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.11,1:23:37.55,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,被谁
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.18,1:23:39.52,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,安布罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.61,1:23:41.99,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.62,1:23:50.96,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,意志是身体的主人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.29,1:23:56.13,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,他在抵抗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.46,1:24:00.64,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,左手跟右手打架
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.40,1:24:06.97,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,约翰尼加油
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.01,1:24:09.48,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,如果我能打乱频率的话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.57,1:24:11.52,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,就能阻止安布罗斯跟他说话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.99,1:24:30.70,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,英格力士 站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.00,1:24:42.18,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,挺住 挺住
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.61,1:24:47.38,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,五十秒后他就死了 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.18,1:24:51.39,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.18,1:24:53.35,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.35,1:24:56.13,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,- 快扣扳机 - 成功
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.21,1:25:19.15,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,听着 我是西蒙·安布罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.24,1:25:22.05,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,我命令你朝向平开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:27.05,*CHS,960,0,0,0,,十秒
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.55,1:25:30.76,*CHS,961,0,0,0,,快开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.50,1:25:43.14,*CHS,962,0,0,0,,快进去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.23,1:25:45.27,*CHS,963,0,0,0,,快撤
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.74,1:25:51.08,*CHS,964,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.08,1:25:53.52,*CHS,965,0,0,0,,退下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.10,1:26:20.21,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,脉搏越来越弱了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.30,1:26:21.71,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,别放弃他
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.81,1:26:23.28,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,拜托 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.15,1:27:10.42,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,敞开心扉 英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.42,1:27:12.43,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,你会重获新生
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.50,1:27:27.11,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,差点就死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.87,1:27:57.47,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,谢谢你 凯特
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.57,1:27:58.88,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.54,1:28:00.91,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.04,1:28:02.38,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,塔克
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.64,1:28:05.05,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.38,1:28:06.45,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,塔克 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.54,1:28:07.92,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,不介意的话我就不跟你亲了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.04,1:28:09.72,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.72,1:28:14.89,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,安布罗斯在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.83,1:28:28.43,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.57,1:28:30.77,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,长官 你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.90,1:28:35.28,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,行规17章第五条 别对老特工问这问那
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.41,1:28:36.61,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.03,1:28:46.95,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,(您的专属情报局)
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.37,1:30:20.36,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,安布罗斯 你个十足的人渣
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.24,1:30:47.37,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,约翰尼 蛋还不够疼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.08,1:31:00.72,*CHS,988,0,0,0,,你这什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.77,1:31:26.41,*CHS,989,0,0,0,,安布罗斯 结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.08,1:31:32.62,*CHS,990,0,0,0,,你可以背叛祖国 出卖朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.75,1:31:36.25,*CHS,991,0,0,0,,但你不能逃脱约翰尼·英格力士的法...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.67,1:31:54.62,*CHS,992,0,0,0,,别了 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.98,1:32:02.35,*CHS,993,0,0,0,,D-7防弹伞
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.28,1:32:05.45,*CHS,994,0,0,0,,防弹的哟
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.02,1:32:09.52,*CHS,995,0,0,0,,不管用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.95,1:32:11.99,*CHS,996,0,0,0,,那个是T-2榴弹啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.12,1:32:13.83,*CHS,997,0,0,0,,- 是... - 他还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.83,1:32:14.83,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,是T-2
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.29,1:32:17.50,*CHS,999,0,0,0,,合上啊 合上
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.63,1:32:19.30,*CHS,1000,0,0,0,,破玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.54,1:32:34.02,*CHS,1001,0,0,0,,噢 约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.65,1:32:41.06,*CHS,1002,0,0,0,,还真是T-2
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.99,1:32:48.40,*CHS,1003,0,0,0,,塔克 人小鬼大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.85,1:33:10.09,*CHS,1004,0,0,0,,我无比的高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.18,1:33:12.25,*CHS,1005,0,0,0,,旋风组的雇主被捕了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.35,1:33:13.85,*CHS,1006,0,0,0,,而中国政府也表达了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.85,1:33:16.19,*CHS,1007,0,0,0,,对英国和组织的感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.69,1:33:19.22,*CHS,1008,0,0,0,,我们得好好谢谢英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.53,1:33:26.91,*CHS,1009,0,0,0,,恢复他的骑士荣誉是个积极的表示
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.03,1:33:28.41,*CHS,1010,0,0,0,,对他本人也是无上光荣
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.87,1:33:32.90,*CHS,1011,0,0,0,,女王陛下随后驾临
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.62,1:34:20.75,*CHS,1012,0,0,0,,还跑 看你跑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.00,1:34:34.34,*CHS,1013,0,0,0,,往哪儿跑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.43,1:34:40.64,*CHS,1014,0,0,0,,受够了 你个老妖精
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.70,1:34:43.65,*CHS,1015,0,0,0,,看你还往哪儿跑 帕加索斯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.71,1:34:44.81,*CHS,1016,0,0,0,,英格力士
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.87,1:34:47.50,*CHS,1017,0,0,0,,就是她 就是那个清洁工杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.50,1:34:49.19,*CHS,1018,0,0,0,,终于被我抓到了
